    <briefdescription>
<para>Raw high-precision timestamp — three-word snapshot. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The overflow counter is read before and after the hardware counter register. Resolution compares the two MSB reads to detect whether an overflow occurred during the capture, and uses the LSB value to determine which MSB is correct for the captured instant.</para>
<para>12 bytes, naturally aligned. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
